window.products.push({"id":460103,"name":"Gesentur Airtight Food Storage Containers with Lids, 7 Pack Plastic Cereal Containers Set for Kitchen Pantry Organization, BPA-Free Clear Storage Cani","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JeEIeD6oL._AC_SL1362_.jpg","description":"Food Grade Plastic Material: Gesentur airtight food storage containers are make of BPA-free PP+TRP+PET material. The clear cereal container body have been tested to be strong and durable enough for long-lasting use. It is also convenient for you to identify the contents without opening them, to get anything you want quickly, conform to your high standards. Total 7 Pack Pasta Container with 4 Sizes: 1 x Tall Container (4.13\"x4.13\"x12\", 1.9L/1.8qt). 2 x Large Containers (4.17\"x4.17\"x8.07\", 1.2L/1.14qt). 2 x Midium Containers (4.17\"x4.17\"x6.1\", 0.8L/0.76qt). 2 x Small Containers (4.13\"x4.13\"x4.13\", 0.5L/0.47qt). The spaghetti containers are perfect for storing flour, sugar, oats, nuts, snacks, pasta, coffee and tea etc, no mess any more. This set comes in a box which makes it an IDEAL GIFT for any family. Advanced Air Tight to Keep Food Dry and Fresh: Our food storage containers feature double sealing with upgraded lifting lid sealing mechanism and silicone gasket, also adopting bevel seal mouth design to well protect your food from pests, as well as moisture and air oxidization. You don't need to worry about your favorite foods turning stale anymore! The top flips open easily, just one hand to open & lock, make everything more convenient. Stackable Design for Space Saving: These plastic pasta containers will make more efficient use of every inch of your kitchen pantry cabinets due to its stackable design. Take up less space and will easily fit into your cupboard or freezer which enables you to get the food neatly organized and frees up space in the pantry. Also provide the different choices to classify your different food. For long-term use, please do not put them in the dishwasher. Freezer safe. Reusable Labels and Marker: Except 7 pack airtight containers, you will also get 18 pieces labels and a marker. The labels help you identify similar food easily and quickly (wow, you never confuse flour with powdered sugar or baking powder with baking soda any more). The labels are reusable, just wipe it with a damp cloth to change what you have written. It won't leave a labeling marks after ripping it off the container, you can switch contents whenever you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JeEIeD6oL._AC_SL1362_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gesentur","source_asin":"B08D38RZ3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-460103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D38RZ3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D38RZ3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
