window.products.push({"id":460204,"name":"JOYOUNG Bonus Pack DJ13U-D08D Easy-Clean Automatic Hot Soy Milk Maker (Full Stainless Steel Design) with Free Soybean Bonus Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410rBFtcfXL._AC_.jpg","description":"JOYOUNG DJ13-D08D is a fully automatic home kitchen appliance that can be used to make Soy Milk, Juice, Jam, Rice Paste. It's computer controlled, and will automatically pre-heat, grind then cook on its own at a simple push of a button. Using the DJ13-D08D, you could be drinking fresh, healthy soy milk in less than 25 minutes. D08D uses super micro grinding device and simmer boiling. It adopts double shell and chassis heating. D08D also has a new Easy Washing function and it can save your time after each usage. The Joyoung DJ13-D08D is the next generation of smart soy milk makers. Contemporarily styled, all parts that come in touch with food and liquid are made from food service grade stainless steel. Features - Micro-computer Control, Totally Automatic Operation - New Double Shell and Chassis Heating Technology - New \"Easy Washing\" Function, Save Your Time - No Internal Filter To Clean, Making Clean-Up Easy! - Makes up to 1.3 Liter of fresh milk from soy beans, rice, mung beans, almonds and etc - Six intelligent protection functions for safe operation Soy Milk Health Benefits - Reduce the risk of heart disease due to cholesterol free and high fiber. - Reduce the risk of digestive disorders due to high fiber content. - Dairy-free and ideal for people with lactose intolerance and milk allergies. What's Included - D08D Soy Milk Maker (English/Chinese Bi-Language Model, Good for All Customers) - AC Power Cord - Plastic pitcher - Metal strainer - scrub pad - 1 Year USA Warranty - FREE Bonus Pack: 0.3LB NON-GMO Soybean samples gift bag & Coupon","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410rBFtcfXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYOUNG","source_asin":"B00730PTGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-460204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00730PTGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00730PTGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
