window.products.push({"id":460222,"name":"AVF FSL1000BLESB-A Blenheim - TV Stand with Dual Cabinet Doors and Optional TV Mount - 1000, Satin Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yr35PXqhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Designed with you Combining experience and insight in consumer trends with the largest ever research project of living rooms, AVF has discovered which TV Stands people really want. Our research identified three key areas. Style: The real wood veneers and black glass of the Affinity Collection have been selected to blend technology seamlessly with modern decor styles. Versatility: The space saving curved designs in the Affinity Collection have been developed to allow them to sit perfectly along flat walls, as well as in corners. Cable mess behind TVs is a real turn off. All TV Stands in the Affinity Collection have been designed to subtly channel and manage cables out of sight, for a tidier finish. From the Manufacturer Combining experience and insight into customer needs, along with the largest ever research project into how people interact in their living rooms, AVF has discovered what people truly look for in a TV stand. Presenting the AVF Affinity collection--a selection of TV stands that bring style, versatility, and superior cable management into any home. Available in a variety of colors to suit your style and decor. View larger Featuring a tilting AVF mount that allows for fingertip adjustments to the perfect viewing angle The real wood veneers and black glass of the Affinity collection have been selected to blend technology seamlessly with modern decor styles. The space-saving curved designs of the collection have been developed to allow them to sit perfectly along flat walls, as well as in corners. And all TV stands in the Affinity series have been designed to subtly channel and manage cables out of sight, for a tidier finish. The Blenheim FSL1000 Series can be configured three different ways to suit your needs Blenheim Series Both elegant and modern, the quality of the Blenheim series is there for all to see. While leading the trend towards softer shapes, Blenheim features not only an open shelf suitable for infrared reception but also a closed storage cabinet. 3-in-1 TV Stand This version of the Blenheim is a '3-in-1' TV stand which can be configured as just as a TV stand, a TV stand and separate wall mount, or a TV stand with column and wall mount. For the perfect viewing angle there is fingertip adjustment to the tilting AVF mount with up to an 18 degree tilt. Further adjustment comes from the height adjustable mount position on the column. Open Shelf Design The AVF FS1100 TV stand with its open shelf and cabinet is designed in wood veneer and is perfect for positioning in the corner or flat to a wall. The double door cabinet storage features a piano hinge which offers 180 degree opening and full width access. Flow-Through Ventilation Within the cabinet there is a slatted base panel for flow-through ventilation, to help keep your home theater components running cool and clean. Cable Management As with all AVF products, cable management is provided to ensure ease of routing for the TV and associated AV equipment. Incredibly Easy to Assemble The Affinity series features simple, do-it-yourself installation usually requiring nothing more than a screwdriver. The cabinet has safety glass tested to British Standard 6202a and is simple to place. Technical Specifications Screen Sizes: up to 55\" (140cm) Screen Sizes: up to 55\" (140cm) Maximum TV Weight: 121lbs (55kg) Maximum TV Weight: 121lbs (55kg) VESA Compatibility: 75x75mm to 660x400mm VESA Compatibility: 75x75mm to 660x400mm Number of Shelves: 2 Number of Shelves: 2 Maximum Lower Shelf Weights: 1st - 55lbs (25kg); 2nd - 55lbs (25kg) Maximum Lower Shelf Weights: 1st - 55lbs (25kg); 2nd - 55lbs (25kg) Which Model of the Affinity Blenheim Series is Right for You? FS800 FS1100 FSL1000 Type TV Stand with Cabinet TV Stand with Cabinet Combination 3-in-1 TV Standand Cabinet with Optional Mount Available Finishes Oak | Walnut Oak | Walnut | Satin Black Oak | Walnut | Satin Black TV Size Up to 37\"(Up to 82 lbs) 32\" - 55\"(Up to 121 lbs) 32\" - 55\"(Up to 121 lbs) Dimensions (WxHxD) 31.5\" x 21.75\" x 15\" 43.25\" x 21.75\" x 16.5\" 39.5\" x 48.75\" x 17.5\" Cable Management Closed Storage Safety Glass Height Adjustable Column AVF Mounting Technology","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yr35PXqhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AVF","source_asin":"B007KJ1RM4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-460222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007KJ1RM4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007KJ1RM4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
