window.products.push({"id":460233,"name":"NutriMill Harvest Stone Grain Mill, 450 Watt - Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":345.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cI3L1hsfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why mill your own flour, when it's so readily available? Commercial mills remove the most nutritious part of the grain in processing, even whole grain flour. Whole grain flours spoil quickly because the bran has been broken which allows oxygen to reach all parts of the grain. Milling your own flour not only ensures that your flour is as nutritious as it can be, it also has a wonderful taste that is lost to commercially made whole-grain flour. The NutriMill Harvest grain mill gives you the control over the quality of food you consume.With its bamboo cabinet, the NutriMill Harvest's form matches its function. Its synthetic stone milling heads will grind a full range of textures from cracked grain to pastry fine flour, with an easy-adjust texture control knob, allowing you to make all your favorite recipes with home milled grains.Built to last, designed, assembled and tested in the USA, the Harvest mill uses only the highest quality components to give you many years of reliable service. German quality ceramic grinding stones create a low-heat milling process that does not destroy vitamins and minerals.The NutriMill Harvest mill will grind soft or hard wheat, oat groats (dehulled oats), rice, triticale, kamut, spelt, buckwheat, barley, rye, millet, teff, quinoa, amaranth, sorghum and dent (field) corn. It will also grind lentils and dry beans (pinto, red, garbanzo, kidney & more.) It isn't suitable for spices, herbs, oilseeds like flax or sesame, or fibrous materials.Grind what you need when you need it. Make a blend of grains for hot cereal take your through the morning, fortify dishes with ground lentils for a healthy thickener, or grind pastry flour for a light and lofty birthday cake.5 year warranty on all parts and factory workmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cI3L1hsfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nutrimill","source_asin":"B01MTZZ6UA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-460233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MTZZ6UA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MTZZ6UA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":460234,"name":"McIntosh Vincent Van Gogh Irises Fine Bone China (19.6 oz) Grande Mug in Matching Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rtp5Y4LhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This gorgeous mug features with a pattern of \"Irises\" by Old Master artist - Vincent Van Gogh. Vincent van Gogh (1853-1890) -- Van Gogh’s paintings provide a scintillating, vivid view of casual scenes and subjects. Visually unique in his time, Van Gogh’s work went unappreciated during his life but has since become among the most recognizable and beloved art in the world. This mug is made of fine bone china, good quality, elegant and yet durable. It is also practical, light weight, easy to clean, which makes it suitable for everyday use. A good quality mug makes a cup of hot beverage taste so much better. This product also comes in an attractive gift box, which makes it ideal to give a gift for your special someone or to treat yourself. This beautiful mug is perfect addition to every home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rtp5Y4LhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"McIntosh","source_asin":"B005LVOC7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-460234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005LVOC7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005LVOC7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
