window.products.push({"id":460339,"name":"Sweese 316.101 Butter Crock Keeper, French Butter Dish - Ring Handle - Holds Up to 4oz East and West Coast Butter - Perfect Spreadable - Porcelain, Wh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JNXgjBN0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FRESH, SOFT BUTTER READY AT HAND AT ALL TIMES - You won't settle for hard butter again if you use Sweese butter keeper! This crock keeps your butter soft and spreadable for use on rolls, bread, toast, waffles, pancakes and more, without having a gooey mess on a plate somewhere. RING HANDLE DESIGN - “My old butter keeper had no knob on top and my hands when oily would slip off the lid.” Sweese butter crock with a comfortable ring on the lid, it is easy to hold onto to use. A WATER MARK - There is a little line so you know exactly how much water to put it in to help soften the butter but to also create a water seal so the butter stays fresh. It requires minimal care, and it washes well in the dishwasher (top rack). SO CUTE SHAPE, BUT ENOUGH TO SAVE BUTTER - The bell holds about 1 stick of soft butter plus a little extra, it depends on how you press it. It is extremely practical for your family. Get 2 units if you have a big family. TRICKS AND TIPS - Adding a little salt or vinegar to the water is helpful to keep fresh, while it doesn't affect the taste of the butter either. Refresh your water every 2-3 days and this could be part of your morning routine. The butter container works best with real butter instead of margarine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JNXgjBN0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweese","source_asin":"B07SDD4755","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-460339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SDD4755","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SDD4755","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
