window.products.push({"id":460411,"name":"Drawer and Shelf Liner, Shelf Liner Non Adhesive Refrigerator Mats Washable, No Odor Plastic Pantry Liners Wire Shelf Paper Drawer Liner for Cupboard ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714W4hFkFQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁【SAFE AND DURABLE MATERIAL】The shelf liner is made of high quality food-grade EVA material, which is super soft and durable. It is totally odor free and BPA free. So it can directly contact fruits and vegetables and protect your health. What’s more, the EVA plastic used is strong and durable. It can serve for several years by daily use. So you don’t have to change it all the time. 🎁【EASY TO USE】Anze drawer liners are delivered with the most popular pre-cut sizes so that they are easily be used. As the EVA plastic is quite easy to trim, you can trim this liner to any size and shape as you wish with normal scissors. You can directly fit the liner into the drawer or cabinet and trim off the excess material. 🎁【EASY TO CLEAN AND WATERPROOF】The non-adhesive shelf liner can easily be removed from your cabinets and cleaned with mild soap, a damp cloth or sponge when the kitchen shelf liner is stained with oil or other dirt, and dries fast. So you can easily keep them clean. The kitchen cabinet liner is waterproof. So it prevents the cabinets, drawers and refrigerators from getting sticky and greasy. 🎁【NON-SLIP DESIGN】The cabinet mat is designed with a beautiful long stripe pattern on one side, and a smooth surface on the other. The stripe pattern enhances the friction between the liner and items on it. This non-slip design can keep your items like kitchen ware safe and tidy. In addition, you can line the old cabinets with newer liners to make them look clean and elegant. 🎁【WIDE RANGE OF USES】Our liner is a good assistance to your household. You can nearly use it in various situations. It's suitable for cabinets, drawers, cupboards, desks, tables, shelves etc. The shelf liner can make your house and kitchen tidy. It's a great choice for organizing your space and home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714W4hFkFQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anze","source_asin":"B0995PX1QZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-460411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995PX1QZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995PX1QZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":460412,"name":"TECHTONGDA Electric Sugar Cane Juicer Press Machine Sugarcane Juice Extractor Ginger Sweet Sorghum Press with 304 Stainless Steel Rollers for Commerci","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":615.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6189z4+E6sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"@【THREE ROLLERS】~ Electric sugar cane juicer is designed with 5-grade gear transmission for less power consumption, driven by heavy duty motor and controlled by pressing buttons to turn on or turn off. It has three stainless steel rollers, can crush the cane to very perfect result. @【CHANGE OVER SWITCH】~ Change-over switch to control the rollers for clockwise or counterclockwise rotation. When the machine is stuck, use this switch to change direction. @【CLOSED STRUCTURE】~ The whole sugar cane juicing price machine is fully closed structure, biogases barrels is inside of the machine, ensure the bagasse and juice wont come out, it’s safe, clean and health. @【NEED CAUTION】~ When the new machine is working for more than half an hour, the motor will emit smoke.This phenomenon is caused by the heat of the lubricant inside the motor.If the machine is working properly, smoking is normal. @【WIDELY APPLICATION】~ Sugarcane juice extractor is widely suitable for the juice pressing of sugar cane, ginger,fresh melons and fruits, etc., with multiple functions. It can be used to extract various sugar cane juice and other fruit and vegetable juice by service occupations like hotels, karaoke, fruit shops, cold drink shops, herbal tea shops, stations and supermarkets, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6189z4+E6sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TECHTONGDA","source_asin":"B075WTYSGR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-460412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075WTYSGR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075WTYSGR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
