window.products.push({"id":460533,"name":"B BAIJIAWEI Power Lift Recliner Chair, Fabric Electric Recliner for Elderly, Heated Vibration Massage Sofa for Living Room, 3 Positions, Thicken Headr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":359.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WgY58MBeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【POWER LIFT RECLINER】 Come with a silent electric motor that could push the entire power lift recliner up or back by two side buttons. It easy to operate to help the elderly stand up or lie down easily, also ideal for persons who have difficulty getting out of a chair. The additional USB charging port allows you to charge the device while sitting or lying down. 2 pockets on the side for small items within reach (Note: The USB ports ONLY for low-power devices, such as iPhone, iPad) 【HEATED VIBRATION MASSAGE】 Our lift recliner chair come with 4 areas of massage(head, shin, thigh, lumbar), 5 modes(pulse, press, wave, auto, normal) and 1 lumbar heating point. Both can turn off in fixed time 15/30/60 minutes. A heating function in the waist area warms and soothes the body's aches and pains as you sit and recline, meaning that it's not only relaxing, but also beneficial to your overall well-being (Heating function works with vibration separately) 【MORE COMFORTABLE DESIGN】 Our lift recliner chair has overstuffed seat, high backrest, and wide armrest offering you more comfort than expected, just like the whole body is wrapped up in chair. It can recline to 140 degrees (the recommended distance from the wall is 39.4), extending footrest and reclining feature allows you to fully stretch and relax, ideal for watching television, sleeping, and reading 【STURDY & CLEAN EASILY】 Overall Dimension: 33.5” W x 29.5” D x 43.3” H ; Seat Dimension: 17.7-23.6” W x 19.7” D x 27.6” H. Made of sturdy frame with a heavy duty steel mechanism is designed to support up to 320 lbs. Breathable and wear-resistant fabric surface is easy to clean with ease. Perfect for living rooms, bedrooms, and theater rooms, office 【ASSEMBLELY & CUSTOMER SERVIVE】 This lift recliner will send in 2 boxes and delivery time of the 2 packages maybe inconsistent. Come with assemble & use instructions. You just need slip the backrest and armrests onto the base and connect 3 cables. If there is any damaged parts of lift recliner, please feel free to contact our friendly customer team, we will resolve your concerns in 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WgY58MBeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"B BAIJIAWEI","source_asin":"B08HTZLFHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-460533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HTZLFHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HTZLFHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
