window.products.push({"id":460909,"name":"Piping Bags 100pcs, Leconico 12 Inch Thickened Pastry Bags, Anti Burst Disposable Frosting bags, Non-slip Icing Bags, Tipless Piping Bags for Cake Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZJJ+xV+AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【THICKENED 100PCS PIPING BAGS】- Anti-burst, Non-slip, our piping bag is made of durable and food grade material that is flexible, strong, reliable and thick enough to withstand pressure of squeezing and frosting without any burst or leakage, not easy to damage, you can use it safely. With these decorating bags on hand, you're free to apply as much pressure as you want. Now, let's say bye to the days of slaving over some weak, easy to burst piping bags! 【PREMIUM MATERIAL PASTRY BAGS】- The pastry bag is made of PE material, nontoxic and tasteless, can directly contact food, ensuring your family is kept completely safe. Safe and ideal for family to bake the decoration in an affordable, fast and simple way. Seamless designed for safety added while decorating pastries, you can feel free to use the icing piping tips with your kids and add family fun time in the kitchen. 【NON-SLIP 12 INCH DISPOSABLE ICING BAGS】- Do you struggle holding icing bags? No matter how much you squeeze, our icing piping bags will give you firm, workable grip that do not slip off hands and a super smooth interior that let icing flow freely and smoothly. The textured surface of the piping bag makes it better to grip and feel nice to handle, which has a good anti-slip effect. 【EASY TO USE DECORATING BAGS】- Works with or without Any Tip or Coupler: Just cut the narrow end of piping bag according to the size of coupler or tip. These pastry bags offer fit well with all sizes of coupler and tips, giving you freedom to create flowers, stars, and unique patterns on cake whether you use tips or not. This disposable decorating bag is a multi-purpose decorating tool designed for professional and home bakers alike, also good cake decorating supplies for beginners. 【WIDE APPLICATIONS】- This 12-inch disposable cake decorating bags suitable for all size tips couplers and baking cookies supplies kits, can easily draw the pattern you want with your different decorative tips. Ideal for instant cake decoration, suitable for decorating wedding cakes, birthday cakes, biscuits, cupcakes, pastries, holiday desserts, etc. Whether you bake regularly or just for special occasions, anyone who likes to be creative in baking will like these pastry bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZJJ+xV+AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"leconico","source_asin":"B09MQ37VBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-460909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MQ37VBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MQ37VBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
