window.products.push({"id":460959,"name":"Electric Heated Blanket Queen Size 84\" x 90\" | 6 Heating Levels & 8h Auto Timer | Full Body Fast Heating and Ultra Soft Flannel, Machine Washable Bed ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mUtDpWM4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flannel Fast Heating & Auto off Setting: The blanket heats up quickly and evenly with 6 heating levels (85°F - 110°F) to customize personal desired comfort. Fast Heating helps you obtain a cozy feeling in short time. Safer and more energy-saving with auto-off timing (1-8H) leave you peace of mind. Overheat protection can protect you and the heated blanket and there is no potential safety hazard. Flexible Use & Machine Washable: The Heated Blanket have two parts, and it is easy to remove. Just take off the heating controller and it can also be as a normal blanket. 10.7ft long power cord allows flexible use in a wider range. The skin-friendly heated blanket is hand/machine washable and highly hydrophobic, easy to care and dry for prolonged softness and service life. Soft Soft Flannel & High-end Warmth: Deluxe soft flannel is skin-friendly and greatly facilitates heat penetration and preservation. Indulge in comfy warmth of this large size (84’ x 90”) to keep yourself refreshed and keep warm in cold weather all the time. The ultra large size covers your full body and you can share it with beloved ones. Easy to Use & Discover Multipurpose Use：Using easily by turning on the power and adjust the temperature you want. It's a Cape Blanket, Napping Blanket, Travel Blanket, Knee Blanket, Sofa Blanket, Decor Blanket. Snuggle on your couch or bed with ultra-warm flannel heated blanket to enjoy happy family hours while watching favorite TV shows. Perfect for indoor and outdoor use with consecutive warmth in chilly weather. Perfect Gift & Quick After-sales: We provide a complete and fashion package, which is a great gift for your family, friends and anyone you loved. We guarantee the quality of the products and provide after-sales to your satisfaction, if you are not satisfied with our products, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mUtDpWM4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIGERM","source_asin":"B0C74CSKL2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-460959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C74CSKL2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C74CSKL2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
